nvc 1.23.1 stops with an internal error on 'VALUE of a record or array type.
The golden follows IEEE 1076-2019 §16.2.2: the parameter is the image of
an aggregate (or, for an array of character literals, a string literal);
blanks around it and around the elements are ignored. The last 'VALUE has
two elements for a three-element array type: an error, as for text that
is no value of a scalar type (GHDL: "bound check failure", exit 1).
